{"ticker":"HPQ","updated":"2026-11-27T22:59:06Z","profile":{"longName":"HP Inc.","shortName":"HP Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Computer Hardware","country":"United States","website":"https://www.hp.com","fullTimeEmployees":null,"marketCap":28992581632,"trailingPE":12.270993,"forwardPE":9.539805,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.47900245,"pegRatio":4.84,"targetMeanPrice":27.55294,"targetHighPrice":33.4,"targetLowPrice":20.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":17,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.093,"earningsGrowth":0.011,"grossMargins":0.19158001,"operatingMargins":0.06156,"profitMargins":0.04006,"totalRevenue":60527001600,"beta":1.211,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":36.23,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":17.56,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":3.98},"summary":"HP Inc. provides personal computing, printing, 3D printing, hybrid work, gaming, and other related technologies in the United States and internationally. The company operates through three segments: Personal Systems, Printing, and Corporate Investments. The Personal Systems segment offers commercial and consumer desktops and notebooks, workstations, thin clients, retail point-of-sale systems, displays, software, hybrid systems, and endpoint security and services, as well as lifecycle services, including support and deployment, configurations, and extended warranty services. The Printing segment provides consumer and commercial printer hardware, supplies, and solutions, as well as office and home printing solutions; and focuses on graphics, 3D printing, and personalization solutions for the commercial and industrial markets. The Corporate Investments segment is involved in the business incubation and investment projects. It serves small- and medium-sized businesses, public sector, and enterprises. The company was formerly known as Hewlett-Packard Company and changed its name to HP Inc. in October 2015. HP Inc. was founded in 1939 and is headquartered in Palo Alto, California.","summary_zh":"HP Inc. 在美國和國際上提供個人運算、列印、3D 列印、混合工作、遊戲和其他相關技術。該公司透過三個部門運作：個人系統部門、印刷部門和企業投資部門。個人系統部門提供商業和消費性桌上型電腦和筆記型電腦、工作站、瘦客戶端、零售銷售點系統、顯示器、軟體、混合系統、端點安全和服務，以及生命週期服務，包括支援和部署、配置和延長保固服務。列印部門提供消費者和商業列印機硬體、耗材和解決方案，以及辦公室和家庭列印解決方案；專注於商業和工業市場的圖形、3D 列印和個人化解決方案。企業投資部門涉及企業孵化和投資項目。它為中小企業、公共部門和企業提供服務。該公司前身為惠普公司，於2015年10月更名為惠普公司。惠普公司成立於1939年，總部位於加州帕洛阿爾托。","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"電腦硬體","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-29","o":26.89,"h":27.05,"l":26.68,"c":26.89,"v":9098200},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":26.9,"h":27.25,"l":26.85,"c":27.23,"v":7986800},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":27.19,"h":27.22,"l":26.4,"c":26.7,"v":14390400},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":26.76,"h":27.15,"l":26.42,"c":26.48,"v":10975400},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":26.61,"h":27.29,"l":26.51,"c":26.64,"v":10520700},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":26.79,"h":26.91,"l":26.44,"c":26.61,"v":7705600},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":26.78,"h":26.84,"l":26.2,"c":26.55,"v":14472800},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":26.58,"h":27.18,"l":26.44,"c":27.03,"v":20463700},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":27.16,"h":27.34,"l":26.73,"c":26.97,"v":10128000},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":27.1,"h":27.18,"l":25.46,"c":25.55,"v":15792400},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":26.03,"h":27.38,"l":26.01,"c":27.35,"v":14137500},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":27.49,"h":28.74,"l":27.4,"c":28.54,"v":21557000},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":28.86,"h":28.99,"l":28.39,"c":28.61,"v":18360300},{"t":"2025-10-16","o":28.69,"h":28.73,"l":27.09,"c":27.2,"v":24747300},{"t":"2025-10-17","o":27.1,"h":27.61,"l":27.0,"c":27.37,"v":10955800},{"t":"2025-10-20","o":27.56,"h":28.09,"l":27.5,"c":27.66,"v":7049700},{"t":"2025-10-21","o":27.73,"h":28.5,"l":27.67,"c":28.16,"v":8330400},{"t":"2025-10-22","o":27.2,"h":27.97,"l":26.97,"c":27.66,"v":8976800},{"t":"2025-10-23","o":27.78,"h":28.14,"l":27.67,"c":27.83,"v":11798700},{"t":"2025-10-24","o":28.26,"h":28.43,"l":27.64,"c":27.66,"v":8626300},{"t":"2025-10-27","o":27.94,"h":28.1,"l":27.71,"c":27.92,"v":10867500},{"t":"2025-10-28","o":27.8,"h":28.19,"l":27.51,"c":28.07,"v":7421200},{"t":"2025-10-29","o":27.88,"h":28.25,"l":27.57,"c":27.7,"v":